  "description_short": "Family-friendly sports bar in Hartenbos serving generous portions of pub grub and cold drinks.",
  "description_long": "Hennie's has been a Hartenbos institution for years, drawing families and sports fans to its lively venue on Paardekraal Avenue. The atmosphere is relaxed and unpretentious, with multiple screens showing live sport and a menu that covers all the pub classics done well. Expect hearty burgers, steaks, pizzas, and seafood platters that won't disappoint when you're hungry after a day at the beach.\n\nThe portions are generous and the vibe is casual, making it a solid choice for families with kids or groups looking for a no-fuss meal. With its sports bar setup and full bar, it's equally suited to catching the rugby with mates over a beer. The location in Seefront puts you close to the Hartenbos beachfront, perfect for a post-swim feed.",
